आपीत 2. आ-पीत, अस्, आ, अम्, yellowish;
(अम्), n. a pyritic mineral. (For 1. आ-पीत see under
आ-पा.)

अपीनस अपी-नस or पी-नस, अस्, m. (अपी
for अपि and नस for नासिका), dryness of the nose,
want of the pituitary secretion and loss of smell, cold.

आ-पीडित, अस्, आ, अम्, compressed, squeezed;
bound tightly, embraced; hurt; decorated with
chaplets.
